    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inye Ruhanga Omukama ningamba nti: Ekihigi kya nyakabuga ey'omunda ekilebire oburugaizoba kikingwega ebiro mukaga eby'emilimo, kyonkai ahali Sabato kikingurwe n'aha kiro ekyo okwezi kulikwema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omutwazi aratahiraga omu kishasi ky'ekihigi eky'aheru, ayemelere bwatana aha muzilingiti gwakyo. Abakuhani bahonge ebihongobye, eky'okwokibwa n'eby'emilembe; kandi wenene afukame ayemire aha muzilingiti gw'ekihigi. Ahanyuma aturuke aheru, kyonkai ekihigi kitakingwa kuhika bwaigoro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli Sabato na buli kwezi kwema, abantu bona bafukamire Omukama bemire aha mulyango gw'ekihigi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekihongo ky'okwokibwa eky'omutwazi arahongeraga Omukama ahali Sabato kirabaga ky'emyana mukaga y'entama etaina kamogo, kwakwo n'empaya y'entama etaina kamogo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ateho na efa y'ekihongo ky'ensano eky'okugenda n'empaya y'entama. Kandi ekihongo ky'emyaka eky'okugenda n'emyana y'entama ekyo aragira okwo arashoboraga, ayongereho n'ehini y'amajuta aha rwa buli efa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiro ky'okwezi kwayema ahonge enumi y'ekigeto etaina kamogo, emyana mukaga y'entama n'empaya y'entama, byona ebyo bibe bitaina kamogo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ateho ekihongo ky'ensano efa emoi aha bwa buli numi, efa emoi aha bwa buli mpaya y'entama, n'ensano nyingi ey'alikushobora aha bw'emyana y'entama, hamoi n'ehini emoi y'amajuta aha bwa buli efa y'ensano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omutwazi k'aliba nataha Rwensinga, atahire omu kishasi ky'ekihigi; mara n'omu kushohora abe nimwo araba.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Orwo embaga eliba neija kufukamira Omukama aha biro bikuru ebiragiirwe, omuntu alikutahira omu kihigi ekya bikara omu kuturuka arabe omu kihigi ekya kasi, alikutahira omu kihigi ekya kasi omu kuturuka arabe omu kihigi ekya bikara. Omuntu n'omoi ataliturukira mu kihigi ekyo aliba atahiiremu, shana ayasize kimoi omu maisho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwo balikutahamu, omutwazi atahemu nabo. Orwo baturuka, omutwazi aturuke nabo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omu biro bikuru ebyo, n'omu biro bikuru ebindi ebiragiirwe, ekihongo ky'ensano efa emoi aha rwa buli numi y'ekigeto, efa emoi aha rw'empaya y'entama, kandi aha rw'emyana y'entama omuntu agire ensano nk'okwo alikushobora. Kandi buli efa emoi agiteho ehini y'amajuta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwo omutwazi aligira ekihongo ky'obweyendezi, kibe kihongo ky'okwokibwa anga ebihongo by'emilembe, kyonkai nabihongera Omukama ayeyendeire, bamukingulire ekihigi ekilebire oburugaizoba. Ekihongokye eky'okwokibwa anga ebihongobye eby'emilembe abitambe nk'okwo abitamba aha kiro kya Sabato. Ahanyuma aturuke, mara orwo alikumara kuturuka ekihigi kikingwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Buli kiro omutwazi agire omwana gw'entama ogw'omwaka gumoi ogutaina kamogo ogw'okutambira Omukama ekihongo ky'okwokibwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mara buli bwankya obwo omwana gw'entama aguteho ekihongo ky'ensano ekisaine ekichweka kya mukaga kya efa, n'ekichweka kya kashatu ky'ehini y'amajuta g'okukandisa ensano, ekihongo ky'ensano ekyo bakihongere Omukama. Ogu mugenzo gw'ekihongo ky'okwokibwa eky'orubelera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwana gw'entama n'ekihongo ky'ensano n'amajuta bigirwe omu bwankya, aha rw'ekihongo ky'okwokibwa ekya buli bwankya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inye Ruhanga Omukama ningamba nti: Omu butakabwe obwo asikiire omutwazi k'alishaliramu abaanabe ekichweka akakibagabira, ekyo kiliba kichweka ky'abaanabe, bwaba butaka bwabo babusika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai omu butakabwe obwo asikiire k'alishaliramu omwiruwe ekichweka akakimugabira, ekichweka ekyo kiliba ky'omwiru ogwo kulemwa kugoba aha mwaka gw'omuntu kugarulira ekintu mukama wakyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omutwazi atalyaka bantu busika bwabo, kububabingamu. Abaanabe abashalire omu busika obwe, abe nimwo abasikisa, abantu bange batalyakwa mataka gabo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho omushaija yanturukiza omu mulyango ogwabaire guli aha rubaju rw'ekihigi yangobya bikara aha rujuru rw'ebiyumba ebitakatifu eby'abakuhani. Aha nzindo bwoli y'ebiyumba ebyo mukono ogw'obugwaizoba, mbonayo omwanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angambira ati, “Ogu mwanya gw'abakuhani kuchumbiraho ebihongo eby'enyatano y'entambara n'eby'enyatano y'amafu. Kandi babe niho bakandira ekihongo ky'ensano: Batalibiturukya nyakabuga ey'aheru bikaija bikahutaza mbaga.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahanyuma antwara nyakabuga ey'aheru, angobya omu pembe zayo inai. Buli nshonda ya nyakabuga ekaba eli nyakabuga eyemaliire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zikaba zili nyakabuga inai ezike omu nshonda za nyakabuga ey'aheru. Zikaba zina oburai bw'emikono 40 n'obukika bw'emikono 30. Zona hamoi inai zikaba ziganiraine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyakabuga ezo ezike omunda yazo, buli emoi ekaba ezingoirwe orukuta rw'amabare, ahansi nirugenda n'amahiga obuzingora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikwo kungambira ati, “Aga machumbiro ago abakozi ba Rwensinga barataga kuchumbiramu ebitambo by'embaga.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
